<style>.show{font-size:18px;line-height:1.45}.show *{box-sizing:border-box}
.show section{min-height:60vh;padding:5vh 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.show .k{font:600 13px/1 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:2vh}
.show h1{font:800 clamp(34px,6vw,64px)/1.05 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 2vh}.show h1 em{color:var(--accent)}
.show h2{font:700 clamp(24px,3.4vw,38px)/1.15 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 3vh;border:0;padding:0}
.show .sub{color:var(--ink-2);font-size:20px}.show .tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:16px;margin:2vh 0}
.show .tiles div{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink-2)}.show .tiles b{display:block;font:800 44px/1.1 Georgia,serif;color:var(--ink)}
.show .bars .b{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr 50px;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:10px 0}.show .bars i{display:block;height:26px;border-radius:6px}
.show .bars.small .b{grid-template-columns:300px 1fr 40px;margin:6px 0;font-size:15px}.show .bars.small i{height:16px}
.show .chart{width:100%}.show ul,.show ol{font-size:21px}.show li{margin:.6em 0}
@media (max-width:700px){.show .bars .b{grid-template-columns:90px 1fr 36px}.show .bars.small .b{grid-template-columns:160px 1fr 30px}}</style>
<div class="show"><section><div class="k">Web Summit 2026 · stand-up · Wed 4 Nov, 14:30</div><h1>24 hours of the team, <em>shown</em>, not told</h1><p class="sub">Built from the repository at 14:28 UTC. Nobody was asked what they did.</p><div class="tiles"><div><b>255</b>agent commits</div><div><b>195</b>releases</div><div><b>35</b>agents at work</div><div><b>5 days</b>to the summit</div></div></section><section><div class="k">Who moved</div><h2>Commits in 24 hours, by person (their agents)</h2><div class="bars"><div class="b"><span>Dinis</span><i style="width:100%;background:#111111"></i><b>80</b></div><div class="b"><span>Vicky</span><i style="width:74%;background:#7c3aed"></i><b>59</b></div><div class="b"><span>Jose</span><i style="width:57%;background:#0e7490"></i><b>46</b></div><div class="b"><span>Indi</span><i style="width:34%;background:#c2410c"></i><b>27</b></div><div class="b"><span>Angelo</span><i style="width:30%;background:#15803d"></i><b>24</b></div><div class="b"><span>Silvio</span><i style="width:24%;background:#b91c1c"></i><b>19</b></div></div><p class="sub">Vicky's agents are second only to Dinis's, on day two of joining.</p></section><section><div class="k">When</div><h2>The team never stopped: commits per hour since yesterday 14:30</h2><svg viewBox="0 0 900 145" class="chart"><rect x="0.0" y="87.0" width="35.5" height="33.0" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-03T14:00 UTC, 9 commits</title></rect><rect x="37.5" y="65.0" width="35.5" height="55.0" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-03T15:00 UTC, 15 commits</title></rect><rect x="75.0" y="76.0" width="35.5" height="44.0" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-03T16:00 UTC, 12 commits</title></rect><rect x="112.5" y="46.7" width="35.5" height="73.3" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-03T17:00 UTC, 20 commits</title></rect><rect x="150.0" y="94.3" width="35.5" height="25.7" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-03T18:00 UTC, 7 commits</title></rect><rect x="187.5" y="101.7" width="35.5" height="18.3" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-03T19:00 UTC, 5 commits</title></rect><rect x="225.0" y="101.7" width="35.5" height="18.3" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-03T20:00 UTC, 5 commits</title></rect><rect x="262.5" y="112.7" width="35.5" height="7.3" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-03T21:00 UTC, 2 commits</title></rect><rect x="300.0" y="94.3" width="35.5" height="25.7" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-03T22:00 UTC, 7 commits</title></rect><rect x="337.5" y="68.7" width="35.5" height="51.3" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-03T23:00 UTC, 14 commits</title></rect><rect x="375.0" y="46.7" width="35.5" height="73.3" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T00:00 UTC, 20 commits</title></rect><rect x="412.5" y="76.0" width="35.5" height="44.0" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T01:00 UTC, 12 commits</title></rect><rect x="450.0" y="105.3" width="35.5" height="14.7" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T02:00 UTC, 4 commits</title></rect><rect x="487.5" y="112.7" width="35.5" height="7.3" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T03:00 UTC, 2 commits</title></rect><rect x="525.0" y="105.3" width="35.5" height="14.7" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T04:00 UTC, 4 commits</title></rect><rect x="562.5" y="112.7" width="35.5" height="7.3" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T06:00 UTC, 2 commits</title></rect><rect x="600.0" y="61.3" width="35.5" height="58.7" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T07:00 UTC, 16 commits</title></rect><rect x="637.5" y="94.3" width="35.5" height="25.7" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T08:00 UTC, 7 commits</title></rect><rect x="675.0" y="98.0" width="35.5" height="22.0" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T09:00 UTC, 6 commits</title></rect><rect x="712.5" y="21.0" width="35.5" height="99.0" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T10:00 UTC, 27 commits</title></rect><rect x="750.0" y="46.7" width="35.5" height="73.3" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T11:00 UTC, 20 commits</title></rect><rect x="787.5" y="10.0" width="35.5" height="110.0" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T12:00 UTC, 30 commits</title></rect><rect x="825.0" y="98.0" width="35.5" height="22.0" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T13:00 UTC, 6 commits</title></rect><rect x="862.5" y="109.0" width="35.5" height="11.0" rx="2" fill="currentColor" style="color:var(--accent)"><title>2026-11-04T14:00 UTC, 3 commits</title></rect><text x="0.0" y="138" font-size="11" fill="#666">14h</text><text x="112.5" y="138" font-size="11" fill="#666">17h</text><text x="225.0" y="138" font-size="11" fill="#666">20h</text><text x="337.5" y="138" font-size="11" fill="#666">23h</text><text x="450.0" y="138" font-size="11" fill="#666">02h</text><text x="562.5" y="138" font-size="11" fill="#666">06h</text><text x="675.0" y="138" font-size="11" fill="#666">09h</text><text x="787.5" y="138" font-size="11" fill="#666">12h</text></svg><p class="sub">The night shift is agents: briefs, reviews, keys, vaults, releases.</p></section><section><div class="k">The agents</div><h2>The busiest agents</h2><div class="bars small"><div class="b"><span>conductor@web-summit.vicky</span><i style="width:100%;background:#7c3aed"></i><b>26</b></div><div class="b"><span>conductor@web-summit.jose</span><i style="width:81%;background:#0e7490"></i><b>21</b></div><div class="b"><span>procurement@web-summit.silvio</span><i style="width:69%;background:#b91c1c"></i><b>18</b></div><div class="b"><span>conductor@web-summit.dinis</span><i style="width:69%;background:#111111"></i><b>18</b></div><div class="b"><span>pm@web-summit.vicky</span><i style="width:58%;background:#7c3aed"></i><b>15</b></div><div class="b"><span>mentor@web-summit.dinis</span><i style="width:50%;background:#111111"></i><b>13</b></div><div class="b"><span>journalist@web-summit.dinis</span><i style="width:46%;background:#111111"></i><b>12</b></div><div class="b"><span>conductor@web-summit.angelo</span><i style="width:42%;background:#15803d"></i><b>11</b></div><div class="b"><span>conductor@web-summit.indi</span><i style="width:35%;background:#c2410c"></i><b>9</b></div><div class="b"><span>dev@web-summit.dinis</span><i style="width:35%;background:#111111"></i><b>9</b></div><div class="b"><span>vault@web-summit.jose</span><i style="width:35%;background:#0e7490"></i><b>9</b></div><div class="b"><span>designer@web-summit.indi</span><i style="width:31%;background:#c2410c"></i><b>8</b></div></div></section><section><div class="k">Keys are flying</div><h2>Everyone gets a key to the site (WS-136)</h2><div class="tiles"><div><b>5</b>keys issued<br><small>Dinis, Jose, Indi, Angelo, Vicky</small></div><div><b>3</b>keys added<br><small>Dinis, Angelo, Vicky</small></div><div><b>1</b>signed message between two people<br><small>Vicky to the conductor, verified, answered sealed to her key</small></div></div><p class="sub">Next: Silvio, Nimay; then Angelo's and Jose's vault-to-vault lanes (WS-120).</p></section><section><div class="k">The newsroom</div><h2>web-summit.newsroom.sgit.ai</h2><ul><li><b>Live</b>, the skeleton (v0.1.1), by newsroom@web-summit.dinis</li><li><b>Indi</b> reviewed the three earlier newsrooms and made a patch that turns it into a publication</li><li><b>The brief pack</b> is live at /brief/: Dinis's vision memo verbatim, nine pages from it</li><li><b>To decide now:</b> apply Indi's patch; push access for Indi and Vicky; Indi editorial, Vicky research and programme</li></ul></section><section><div class="k">What else shipped</div><h2>Since yesterday's 18:00</h2><ul><li><b>A command centre for every person</b>, from Silvio's design, with a switcher</li><li><b>Who are you?</b> on every page: a For-you panel per section</li><li><b>Indi's business cards</b> on /cards/, tested with synthetic users</li><li><b>Vicky's plain-language onboarding guide</b> (WS-100)</li><li><b>Jose's reviewer agent</b> holds work until it is right (it caught two wrong claims)</li><li><b>Dinis's lab</b>: nine experiments, the policy studio first</li></ul></section><section><div class="k">Decide</div><h2>For this stand-up</h2><ol><li><b>The newsroom:</b> Indi's patch, push access for Indi and Vicky, who owns which desk</li><li><b>The print date:</b> the printer may slip to Monday 9 Nov: who collects?</li><li><b>The generic QR:</b> yes in the designer's session, then everyone re-signs</li><li><b>Who records today's decisions</b> (nothing recorded yet from Tuesday)</li></ol></section></div>
